# The inbox comes to you (P4, R4): at acme's first desk, the busy fixture (5 active cats, a letter):
# api-gateway (blocked), alpha (done) and the postman leave their rooms and come; each hops onto a
# desk top that frames it whole from your station (head in the middle band, ears in, off your
# screen, ≥ 1.6 m away), else sits on the floor before you. User-approval shot.
key J
wait 500
inject cats {"fixture":"busy"}
wait json /ext/cats/inbox/visible 3 4000
wait 20000
shot ${OUT}/shot-cats-inbox.png
dump ${OUT}/dump-cats-inbox.json
quit
